flowchart TD
    Start([hexa gh label sync])

    Start --> Checks

    subgraph Checks[Validation Checks]
        C1[git repo]
        C2[gh auth]
        C3[remote]
        C4[jq installed]
        C5[config exists]
    end

    Checks --> AllOk{all pass?}
    AllOk -->|NO| Err[Return error]
    AllOk -->|YES| ConfigExists{.hexa.yml exists?}

    ConfigExists -->|NO| CreateConfig[Create .hexa.yml]
    ConfigExists -->|YES| Prompt

    CreateConfig --> Prompt

    Prompt[promptUserForSync]
    Prompt --> Confirm{user confirms?}

    Confirm -->|NO| Exit[Exit cleanly]
    Confirm -->|YES| Fetch

    Fetch[gh.FetchLabels]
    Fetch --> FetchOk{success?}

    FetchOk -->|NO| Err
    FetchOk -->|YES| GetPath

    GetPath[config.GetProjectConfigPath]
    GetPath --> PathOk{success?}

    PathOk -->|NO| Err
    PathOk -->|YES| Update

    Update[config.UpdateYAMLField]
    Update --> UpdateOk{success?}

    UpdateOk -->|NO| Err
    UpdateOk -->|YES| Pretty

    Pretty[jq.PrettyPrint]
    Pretty --> Success[Success]

    Err --> Stop[Exit 1]

    style Success fill:#51cf66,stroke:#2f9e44,color:#fff
    style Exit fill:#51cf66,stroke:#2f9e44,color:#fff
    style Stop fill:#ff6b6b,stroke:#c92a2a,color:#fff
    style Err fill:#ff6b6b,stroke:#c92a2a,color:#fff
